  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.Interaction.Examinable
  range: 1.35
  point: {fileID: 0}
  comment: Aw, man. I tuned in right at the end! Things to Come is the best cartoon
    I've ever seen. Like Starship Troopers, you can watch it for the pew-pew space
    lasers, or as a meditation on progress and technology. And this one is clearly
    on the side of the man in the arena, as Roosevelt said. Well, I can ask a nurse
    to put in the Blu-ray so I can catch up later.
  emptyComment: Nothing else of note here.
  thing: the TV
  contents: []
